Package: Proximum
Title: Statistical Analysis of Ensemble Proximity Matrices
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Agostino",
           family = "Gnasso",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "agostino.gnasso@unina.it",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8046-3923"))
Description: Treats the proximity matrices produced by tree ensembles as
    first-class statistical objects rather than as model by-products.
    Provides a unified extractor across ensemble engines, transformations
    to dissimilarities with metric diagnostics, permutation-based
    inference for comparing proximity matrices, bootstrap stability
    assessment, scalable approximations for large samples, and dedicated
    visualisations.
